TRYING TO VERIFY THE

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:43.610 line:0%
INFORMATION, AND THAT THEY ONLY

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.711 line:0%
PUBLISHED IT AFTER SHE STARTED

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:46.513 line:0%
ACCUSING THEM PUBLICLY.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.680 line:0%
WE SHOULD NOTE THE COFFEE SHOP

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.449 line:0%
OWNER PREVIOUSLY BARRED THE

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:51.684 line:0%
PAPER FROM COVERING THE PUBLIC

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.620 line:0%
EVENT OF A REPUBLICAN MEMBER OF

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:56.556 line:0%
CONGRESS, MARION COUNTY RECORD

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:57.490 line:0%
PUBLISHER AND EDITOR ERIC MEYER

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.591 line:0%
SAYS THAT HIS 98-YEAR-OLD

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.527 line:0%
MOTHER JOANNE, WHO WAS A

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:02.495 line:0%
CO-OWNER OF THE PAPER,

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:03.663 line:0%
COLLAPSED AND DIED ON SATURDAY,

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.030 line:0%
THE DAY AFTER POLICE RAIDED HER

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.599 line:0%
HOME.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.667 line:0%
ACCORDING TO THE PAPER, MAYER

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.602 line:0%
HAD BEEN STRESSED BEYOND HER

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:11.538 line:0%
LIMITS AND OVERWHELMED BY HOURS

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:12.672 line:0%
OF SHOCK AND GRIEF AFTER THE

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.574 line:0%
ILLEGAL POLICE RAIDS.

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.608 line:0%
ERIC JOINS US NOW.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:19.546 line:0%
GOOD MORNING, ERIC.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:20.146 line:0%
WE ARE ALL DEEPLY SORRY FOR THE

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:20.680 line:0%
LOSS OF YOUR MOTHER.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:21.815 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:22.682 line:0%
I APPRECIATE THAT.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.452 line:0%
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.686 line:0%
WE REACHED OUT TO THE POLICE

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.521 line:0%
ABOUT ALL OF THIS, BECAUSE THEY

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.689 line:0%
DID THIS AND THEY WERE HANDLING

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.757 line:0%
THE INVESTIGATION PRIOR.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.559 line:0%
