00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.765 line:0%
OF THE STORY IS AVAILABLE TO

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.799 line:0%
THE PUBLIC, THE JUDICIAL SYSTEM

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.667 line:0%
THAT IS BEING QUESTIONED WILL

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.469 line:0%
BE VINDICATED.

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:43.770 line:0%
HAVE YOU GOTTEN ANY MORE

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.571 line:0%
ANSWERS FROM POLICE ABOUT WHY

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:47.574 line:0%
THEY DID THIS?

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:49.642 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE FINALLY WERE ABLE TO

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:52.679 line:0%
OBTAIN THE PROBABLE CAUSE

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:53.847 line:0%
AFFIDAVIT THAT WAS SUPPOSED TO

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:55.815 line:0%
SUPPORT THE SEARCH WARRANT.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.450 line:0%
IT WAS FILED THREE DAYS AFTER

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:58.718 line:0%
THE SEARCHES WERE CONDUCTED,

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:03.456 line:0%
IT'S A LITTLE SUSPICIOUS.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:05.492 line:0%
BUT IT INTERESTINGLY REFUTES

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.693 line:0%
MOST OF THE THINGS PLAYED

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:08.561 line:0%
AGAINST US, AND THE ALLEGATIONS

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.662 line:0%
WERE THAT WE OBTAINED THIS

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.698 line:0%
DOCUMENT AND GAVE IT TO THE

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:14.767 line:0%
VICE MAYOR, AND IN THE DOCUMENT

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:15.768 line:0%
ITSELF SHE SAYS SHE GOT IT FROM

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.670 line:0%
THE SAME SOURCE WE GOT IT.

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.138 line:0%
FROM WHICH SUPPORTS OUR

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:21.641 line:0%
CONTENTION.

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:22.675 line:0%
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT WE DON'T

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.610 line:0%
UNDERSTAND IS THAT WE TOLD HIM

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:26.479 line:0%
ABOUT THIS.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:27.614 line:0%
THIS WAS OUR DISCLOSURE TO THEM

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:30.450 line:0%
THAT THERE WAS A DOCUMENT OUT

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:31.718 line:0%
THERE THAT MAYBE SOMEONE HAD

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:33.753 line:0%
DONE, THERE WAS AN ALLEGATION

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:35.488 line:0%
THAT POLICE WERE IGNORING THE

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.589 line:0%
FACT THAT THE RESTAURANT OWNER

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:38.391 line:0%
HAD BEEN DRIVING FOR YEARS

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:39.626 line:0%
WITHOUT A DRIVERS LICENSE, SO

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:41.394 line:0%
WE ORDERED THE POLICE TO --

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.828 line:0%
THEY NEVER ASKED A SINGLE

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.496 line:0%
QUESTION.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:45.431 line:0%
AND AS I UNDERSTAND, SEARCH

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:47.500 line:0%
WARRANTS ARE SUPPOSED TO BE

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:49.435 line:0%
SORT OF A LAST RESORT, IF YOU

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.770 line:0%
CAN'T GET THE INFORMATION IN

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:55.408 line:0%
THE OTHER WAY, THEY COULD ASK.

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:55.842 line:0%
HERE'S THE DOCUMENT WE

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:57.477 line:0%
OBTAINED.

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:58.645 line:0%
IT WAS SITTING ON MY DESK, NEXT

00:02:58.278 --> 00:02:59.679 line:0%
TO THE COMPUTER.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.614 line:0%
THEY DIDN'T TAKE IT.

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:03.683 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE FACT THAT --

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.751 line:0%
AND THIS IS THE FIRST TIME THAT

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.419 line:0%
I'M LEARNING AND WE'RE LEARNING

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:07.520 line:0%
THROUGH OUR REPORTING THAT THE

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:10.323 line:0%
PROBABLE CAUSE I COULD DAVE IT

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:11.024 line:0%
WAS SUBMITTED AFTER THIS

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.558 line:0%
MAGISTRATE JUDGE GRANTED A

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:12.592 line:0%
SEARCH WARRANT.

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:13.026 line:0%
I THINK THAT RAISES IMPORTANT

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.561 line:0%
QUESTIONS.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.529 line:0%
I DO WANT TO NOTE, YOU HAVE

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:17.664 line:0%
SAID THAT THE PAPER WAS

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:19.499 line:0%
INVESTIGATING AT ONE POINT THE

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.401 line:0%
POLICE CHIEF GETTY AND CODY,

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:22.435 line:0%
BUT NEVER PUBLISHED THAT

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:23.536 line:0%
INVESTIGATION, WERE ABLE TO

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:24.604 line:0%
VERIFY SOME OF THE CLAIMS.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:26.439 line:0%
DO YOU HAVE ANY REASON TO

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.707 line:0%
BELIEVE THAT THAT PERSON

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:31.444 line:0%
FACTORED INTO THIS RAID?

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:32.579 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I JUST --

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:35.381 line:0%
SPECULATION.

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:38.585 line:0%
ODDITIES ABOUT THIS, THERE ARE

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:40.587 line:0%
ALSO LONG-STANDING ANIMOSITIES

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:41.621 line:0%
IN THIS TOWN FROM VARIOUS

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.590 line:0%
DIFFERENT FACTIONS.

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:45.658 line:0%
WHEN I TALKED TO THE RESTAURANT

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:47.427 line:0%
OWNER AFTER SHE ACCUSED US OF

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:48.628 line:0%
STEALING THE DOCUMENTS, I WAS

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:49.829 line:0%
NOT TRYING TO GET YOU ON THIS,

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:50.196 line:0%
I WAS TRYING TO GET THE VICE

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:52.465 line:0%
MAYOR.

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:53.466 line:0%
HIS HOUSE WAS ALSO RATED, HER

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:53.866 line:0%
COMPUTER AND HER PHONE WERE

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:57.503 line:0%
ALSO --

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:59.405 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS OBVIOUSLY VERY

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.573 line:0%
IMPORTANT TO YOU, YOUR

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:02.442 line:0%
COMMUNITY, AND YOUR PAPER.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:03.576 line:0%
, BUT THIS IS VERY IMPORTANT TO

00:04:02.609 --> 00:04:04.677 line:0%
AMERICA BECAUSE THIS IS ABOUT

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:05.111 line:0%
FIRST AMENDMENT AND FREEDOM OF

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:07.614 line:0%
THE PRESS.

