YOUR LAWYER WROTE A LETTER TO

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:10.683 line:0%
THE POLICE CHIEF AND SAYING

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:12.552 line:0%
THAT YOU'RE TREATING YOUR PAPER

