LAWSUIT, IS THAT RIGHT?

00:04:15.855 --> 00:04:20.226 line:0%
AND IF SO, ON WHAT GROUNDS?

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:20.860 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE ARE PLANNING TO DO A

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:26.466 line:0%
VIOLATION

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.799 line:0%
 BUT, THAT HAS NOT HAPPENED

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:30.136 line:0%
YET.

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:32.272 line:0%
WE'RE HOPEFUL THAT NOW THAT THE

