PREVAIL, SHALL WE SAY.

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:39.245 line:0%
AND THEY'RE APPARENTLY GOING TO

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:41.114 line:0%
EXAMINE NOT ONLY WHAT THE

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:42.315 line:0%
EVIDENCE SAYS, BUT WHETHER IT

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.349 line:0%
WAS PROPER TO GO AFTER IT THE

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:43.683 line:0%
WAY THAT THEY WERE GOING AFTER

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:46.085 line:0%
IT.

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:48.087 line:0%
&gt;&gt; DOZENS OF NEWS ORGANIZATIONS,

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:49.322 line:0%
INCLUDING CNN, HAVE CONDEMNED

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:52.125 line:0%
WHAT WE'RE SEEING HERE.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:53.259 line:0%
THE FREEDOM OF THE PRESS

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:55.094 line:0%
FOUNDATION CALLED THIS A LATEST

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:57.096 line:0%
EXAMPLE OF AMERICAN LAW

