ENFORCEMENT OFFICERS CHEATING

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:59.065 line:0%
--

00:04:57.563 --> 00:05:00.366 line:0%
IN A MANNER PREVIOUSLY

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:00.767 line:0%
ASSOCIATED WITH AUTHORITARIAN

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:02.201 line:0%
