JUST WHAT THIS INDICATES TO YOU?

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.746 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WELL, I'VE NEVER HEARD OF

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:16.082 line:0%
THIS BEFORE.

