THERE IS ONE CASE YEARS AND

00:05:16.249 --> 00:05:19.452 line:0%
YEARS AGO INVOLVING A STUDENT

00:05:18.251 --> 00:05:20.420 line:0%
NEWSPAPER, BUT WHERE YOU HEAR

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:23.222 line:0%
OF THIS IS IN THE THIRD WORLD.

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:25.091 line:0%
I HAD A GRAD STUDENT, I WAS A

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:26.225 line:0%
FACULTY MEMBER OF THE

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:29.095 line:0%
