00:05:30.963 --> 00:05:34.067 line:0%
LIKE THIS REGULARLY HAPPENING

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:34.434 line:0%
IN THE AUTHORITARIAN REGIME IN

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:37.170 line:0%
EGYPT.

