AND WE DID A PAPER ON HOW THIS

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:42.108 line:0%
DAMAGED JOURNALISTS AND

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:43.309 line:0%
PREVENTED JOURNALIST FROM

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:45.311 line:0%
GETTING INFORMATION ABLE TO SEE

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:46.446 line:0%
IT CLEARLY AND CONCISELY SO

00:05:45.478 --> 00:05:48.348 line:0%
THAT PEOPLE CAN UNDERSTAND IT.

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:51.150 line:0%
THIS WILL DRY UP SOURCES.

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:53.052 line:0%
WE HAD PEOPLE --

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:54.354 line:0%
SINCE WE'VE LOST FOUR COMPUTERS,

00:05:53.219 --> 00:05:57.156 line:0%
I CAN'T GET ON FACEBOOK BECAUSE

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:57.724 line:0%
I'VE GOT A THING THAT'S TIED

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:59.225 line:0%
