THE ORIGINAL LEAD IN THIS, THE

00:06:14.741 --> 00:06:18.611 line:0%
ORIGINAL LEAD TO THE DOCUMENT

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:20.646 line:0%
WAS PROBABLY A GIMMICK AND A

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:24.517 line:0%
DIVORCE CASE.

