AND THAT'S PROBABLY THE REASON

00:06:24.684 --> 00:06:27.620 line:0%
WHY WE DIDN'T RUN IT.

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:28.821 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WELL ERIC, --

00:06:27.787 --> 00:06:30.523 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE HAD INVESTIGATED THE

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:31.090 line:0%
CHIEF, AND WE COULDN'T GET

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:32.692 line:0%
