00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:34.660 line:0%
ALTHOUGH WE ARE NOW HEARING

00:06:32.859 --> 00:06:36.863 line:0%
ADDITIONAL THINGS ABOUT THAT.

00:06:35.428 --> 00:06:39.599 line:0%
SO WE MAY TURN UP AGAIN.

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:41.567 line:0%
UNFORTUNATELY, ALL HER NOTES

00:06:39.766 --> 00:06:42.001 line:0%
ARE IN POSSESSION OF THE CHIEF

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:45.271 line:0%
RIGHT NOW.

