THEY SEIZED A COMPUTER OR A

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:46.372 line:0%
REPORTER THAT WAS WORKING ON

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:46.639 line:0%
THAT.

00:06:47.807 --> 00:06:51.077 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HE WAS GONE IN THE WEEK THAT

00:06:50.009 --> 00:06:51.511 line:0%
ALL THIS HAPPENED, SHE WAS SICK

00:06:51.244 --> 00:06:53.079 line:0%
THIS WEEK.

00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:53.546 line:0%
SO WE DON'T KNOW WHY THAT

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:55.047 line:0%
COMPUTER --

